# Runtime dependencies of the Starling container image: gateway, services process and customer engines.
#
# This is the human-edited input. The image installs only backend/requirements.lock (exact versions
# with hashes for linux/amd64, CPython 3.11), generated from this file by scripts/lock-requirements.sh
# or scripts/lock-requirements.ps1. Lower bounds are the versions the test suites run against; upper
# bounds keep untested major releases (minor releases for 0.x packages) out of a regenerated lock.
# Development and CI tools live in requirements-dev.txt.

